</ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2026-01-01to2026-06-30" escape="true" id="Fact000804" name="us-gaap:ResearchAndDevelopmentExpensePolicy"><p id="xdx_84C_eus-gaap--ResearchAndDevelopmentExpensePolicy_z0FZOkB8dLdd" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b><i><span id="xdx_86F_zZvOBmTln4uc">Research
