<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Advertising
expenses consist primarily of costs of promotion and marketing for the Company&#8217;s image and products, and costs of direct advertising,
and are included in selling expenses. The Company expenses all advertising costs as incurred. Advertising expense was $<span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--AdvertisingExpense_pp0p0_c20260101__20260630__us-gaap--StatementOperatingActivitiesSegmentAxis__us-gaap--SegmentContinuingOperationsMember_zoxGmcVyemUa" title="Advertising expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AdvertisingExpense" contextRef="From2026-01-012026-06-30_us-gaap_SegmentContinuingOperationsMember" id="Fact000890" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="USD">183,858</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--AdvertisingExpense_pp0p0_c20250101__20250630__us-gaap--StatementOperatingActivitiesSegmentAxis__us-gaap--SegmentContinuingOperationsMember_z9SFNqkGMcoe" title="Advertising expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AdvertisingExpense" contextRef="From2025-01-012025-06-30_us-gaap_SegmentContinuingOperationsMember" id="Fact000892" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="USD">103,720</ix:nonFraction></span>
for the six months ended June 30, 2026 and 2025, respectively; and $<span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--AdvertisingExpense_pp0p0_c20260401__20260630__us-gaap--StatementOperatingActivitiesSegmentAxis__us-gaap--SegmentContinuingOperationsMember_zwSFE24tfdo1" title="Advertising expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AdvertisingExpense" contextRef="From2026-04-012026-06-30_us-gaap_SegmentContinuingOperationsMember" id="Fact000894" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="USD">81,872</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--AdvertisingExpense_pp0p0_c20250401__20250630__us-gaap--StatementOperatingActivitiesSegmentAxis__us-gaap--SegmentContinuingOperationsMember_zGPuYD9on5l3" title="Advertising expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AdvertisingExpense" contextRef="From2025-04-012025-06-30_us-gaap_SegmentContinuingOperationsMember" id="Fact000896" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="USD">88,340</ix:nonFraction></span> for the three months ended June 30, 2026 and 2025,
