shares (&#8220;Transaction&#8221;) of common stock of the Company at US$<span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--SharePrice_iI_c20241011_zqqgrHzNaTgi" title="Purchase price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharePrice" contextRef="AsOf2024-10-11" id="Fact001713" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">1.40</ix:nonFraction></span> per share, as disclosed in the Form 8-K filed by the Company
