<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(iii)
Managing the costs of cloud computing infrastructure: our AI software and platform-based services require substantial cloud computing
infrastructure, including graphics processing units and other specialized hardware, to train, deploy, and scale our AI models. The cost
of compute resources represents a significant component of our cost of revenue and operating expenses. Fluctuations in the pricing and
availability of cloud computing capacity may materially affect our gross margins and overall profitability. We seek to optimize our infrastructure
costs through improved model efficiency, strategic partnerships with cloud service providers, and the negotiation of favorable pricing
arrangements. Our ability to manage these costs effectively as we scale our platform will be a key determinant of our financial performance.</span></p>

